[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 791.35, "timestamp": "00:13:11", "text": "これが見えますか？ そうだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 794.23, "timestamp": "00:13:14", "text": "。 だからこのエリアでは、彼が何を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 796.629, "timestamp": "00:13:16", "text": "建てても壊れたりすることはなく、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 797.942, "timestamp": "00:13:17", "author": "@Ghewar_Ji_ka_No-1FAN", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/CqrtcQvHFvr33XJk7uI96qZ5HyIAEb1ifU1jdPzM7vetPMlUZ4oYhF9BjVOj5xYYbkMi18Zfvg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 799.11, "timestamp": "00:13:19", "text": "仲間たちが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 802.23, "timestamp": "00:13:22", "text": "自分たちで修理してくれるだろう。 しかし、もし彼が何か"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 804.31, "timestamp": "00:13:24", "text": "外に何かを建てようとするなら、それは壊れてしまうだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 807.03, "timestamp": "00:13:27", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 809.509, "timestamp": "00:13:29", "text": "だから、PAL ボックスが必要なんです。PAL のようなものから入手できます。B を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 815.91, "timestamp": "00:13:35", "text": "押して PAL に行くと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 818.15, "timestamp": "00:13:38", "text": "PAL ボックスが手に入りますが、今は配置できません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 821.829, "timestamp": "00:13:41", "text": "まずアップグレードして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 824.55, "timestamp": "00:13:44", "text": "土地のビジョンに行きます。PAL"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 826.573, "timestamp": "00:13:46", "author": "@Legend__8055-7", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/h7rPbxlZLgAoQ4WQreLmN5CGuBDaAqrOcRu5IS2bB9ZxFUTHgdnW1GYPK4UM2if6lNaCX_KYaLU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 827.766, "timestamp": "00:13:47", "author": "@redx7454", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ZnCeavb1XjhCUyF0gPZf2zqHWkwDjnzleyD1oxpd-9re-emmqNet6n-8w_OiHe_rvcNpzZPLgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 828.47, "timestamp": "00:13:48", "text": "ボックスを手に入れました。PAL ボックスを持っています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 830.87, "timestamp": "00:13:50", "text": "でも、2 つに制限があるので配置できません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 833.75, "timestamp": "00:13:53", "text": "そこで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 837.11, "timestamp": "00:13:57", "text": "ボックスに行かなければなりません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 839.269, "timestamp": "00:13:59", "text": "だから、壊れるだろう。"}]